## Original Content
<p>Today, Google is expanding its AI Professional Certificate on Coursera with their newest course on vibe coding that helps learners move from AI users to AI builders.&#160; For decades, building software required learning to code. But now, with vibe coding, AI is making it possible for professionals across industries to build applications that automate everyday [&#8230;]</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://blog.coursera.org/google-helps-professionals-with-new-vibe-coding-course/">Google helps professionals become AI creators with new vibe coding course on Coursera</a> appeared first on <a href="https://blog.coursera.org">Coursera Blog</a>.</p>

## Summary
Google is introducing a new course on 'vibe coding' as part of its AI Professional Certificate on Coursera, enabling professionals to move from AI users to AI builders. The course teaches how to create applications that automate tasks without traditional coding, leveraging AI to simplify software development.

## Key Points
- Google expands its AI Professional Certificate with a vibe coding course on Coursera.
- Vibe coding allows non-coders to build AI-powered applications by automating everyday tasks.
- The course aims to help learners transition from AI users to AI creators.
- AI technology is making software development accessible to professionals across industries without coding skills.


